---
manual: button.click
lines: [2918, 2921]
testability: interactive
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  $clicks = 0
  @go = button "Go"
  @go.click { $clicks += 1 }
end
----------- test code
assert_equal 0, $clicks, "the click block waits for a click"

button.trigger_click
assert_equal 1, $clicks, "a click calls the click block"

button.trigger_click
assert_equal 2, $clicks, "once per click"
